{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月23日，宇石空間宣佈，其自主研製的百噸級全尺寸「筷子」捕獲臂已完成聯合地面驗證試驗。據介紹，從試驗平台搭建到試驗結束歷時100餘天，團隊圍繞火箭高可靠回收開展全天候苛刻工況考核，全面覆蓋火箭回收任務剖面，驗證了捕獲臂全天候、全工況、滿負載的作業能力，以及動載工況下的結構穩定性。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587660.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.498163+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:12:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_hash":"ca7635b391fa26ef93f4f324b3298bfdce98f38d7542d4aaa838384ad607519d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}